[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4201925755","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/118248#issuecomment-4201925755","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118248","id":4201925755,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc76dEx7","user":{"login":"bruvzg","id":7645683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NDU2ODM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7645683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg","html_url":"https://github.com/bruvzg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-04-07T20:16:09Z","updated_at":"2026-04-07T20:16:09Z","body":"Can't reproduce, default shortcuts work as expected.\n\nWhat keyboard layout are you using? Shortcuts are set for US-English layout (but are the same in a lot of other layouts) and are `minus` and `equal` (not `plus`, which is secondary key with shift):\n\n<img width=\"408\" height=\"140\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/3dea824e-446a-4ee8-8b19-05a370962731\" />\n\n","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4201925755/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4201957806","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/118248#issuecomment-4201957806","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118248","id":4201957806,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc76dMmu","user":{"login":"bruvzg","id":7645683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NDU2ODM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7645683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg","html_url":"https://github.com/bruvzg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-04-07T20:21:31Z","updated_at":"2026-04-07T20:21:31Z","body":"> try reassigning the shortcut to cmd+plus and shows as cmd+minus\n\nYou can select to use either physical (which is key in US-English layout, in the specific location) and non-physical (key with the specific label in the current layout) when rebinding. So this is normal for physical key to be different from the key label in your layout.\n\nDefault shortcuts are non-physical, so will be triggered by keys with `-` and `=` labels in your layout, not the keys in the specific location.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4201957806/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},